  "title": "Bacon-Wrapped Bratwurst",
  "description": "These bacon-wrapped bratwurst bites are boiled in beer and tossed in brown sugar and cayenne for the best sweet, tangy, and smoky party appetizers.",
  "authors": [
    "Ssharp"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:05:42-05:00",
